# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# 1. Block sourcemaps from being served publicly. Vite builds them in 'hidden'
#    mode (no //# sourceMappingURL comment in the JS), but Sentry needs them
#    at upload time. We 404 the URL so even guessed paths don't leak source.
/assets/*.map  /404  404

# 2. SPA fallback : Cloudflare Pages déjà gère ça automatiquement via
#    le build (single-page-app behavior). Pas besoin de règle ici tant
#    qu'on a un index.html à la racine du dist.
